{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME:</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Explorer is an exploration game with simple puzzles set in popular liminal space environments. You must wander through each level attempting to find the exit and discover items along your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>THE ENVIRONMENT:</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Explorer contains a variety of liminal space levels all with their own unique atmosphere  designed to keep the player focused on their surroundings at all times. Some levels are secret and require deep exploration to unlock them. Levels are based off the Backrooms Wikidot and various viral liminal spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>THE VISUALS:</strong></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Explorer aims to replicate the visuals of the nostalgic  retro gaming era where textures were pixelated and levels were unnerving. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"True Liminal Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966870/d73c576e5f2282de112a0ae63a6d27c64cd15586.jpg"},{"name":"Liminal Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966870/d862f899c740ea75a8f4570ed5dcad099cd1339a.jpg"},{"name":"Wander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966870/36d7d4757566b80fe8b70fa45de75b1edc3d681b.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966870/c00e8ac5381fa57cebd919ee18969bd821e53491.jpg"},{"name":"Promised Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966870/2796e558d466a5bf8655772ae53f73d246c0ea63.jpg"},{"name":"Missing Textures","path":"https://cdn